---
description: Internationalisation and RTL rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Locale: `en` (en-AU) only. Enabling another locale is a `contract-change` in `packages/validators` and `packages/i18n`, with the language in the URL. No hard-coded user-facing strings.
- Deterministic date formatting from `packages/i18n` (no `Intl` in SSR or hydration paths).
- Logical CSS properties only, so RTL can be added without rework.
